  Long            Aux_Type*        Output         Word            Storage_Type*        Output         DoubleLong      Create_Date_Time*        Output         DoubleLong      Mod_Date_Time*        Input          Long            Option_List pointer*        Output         Long            EOF*        Output         Long            Blocks Used*        Output         Long            Resource_EOF*        Output         Long            Resource Blocks (Used)*&lab jsl $E100A8	DC.B	$10,$20	DC.L	&params MEND MACRO&lab _NewLine &params** GS/OS System Call: NEWLINE (subclass 1)**        Input          Word            Pcount (minimum = $0002)*        Input          Word            Reference number*        Input          Word            Enable mask*        Input          Word            Number of characters*        Input          Long            Pointer to NewLine table*&lab jsl $E100A8	DC.B	$11,$20	DC.L	&params MEND MACRO&lab _READ &params** GS/OS System Call: READ (subclass 1)**        Input          Word            Pcount (minimum = $0004)*        Input          Word            Ref_Num*        Input          Long            Data_Buffer*        Input          Long            Request_Count*        Output         Long            Transfer_Count*        Input          Word            Cache_Priority*&lab jsl $E100A8	DC.B	$12,$20	DC.L	&params MEND MACRO&lab _WRITE &params** GS/OS System Call: WRITE (subclass 1)**        Input          Word            Pcount (minimum = $0004)*        Input          Word            Ref_Num*        Input          Long            Data_Buffer*        Input          Long            Request_Count*        Output         Long            Transfer_Count*        Input          Word            Cache_Priority&lab jsl $E100A8	DC.B	$13,$20	DC.L	&params MEND MACRO&lab _CLOSE &params** GS/OS System Call: CLOSE (subclass 1)**        Input          Word            Pcount (minimum = $0001)*        Input